1
00:00:00,563 --> 00:00:05,113
(Sheldon on laptop screen:)Greetings. As you know, I'm not
comfortable with prolonged goodbyes...

2
00:00:05,276 --> 00:00:09,446
(Sheldon:)...and maudlin displays of emotion,
so I've prepared this short video.

3
00:00:09,614 --> 00:00:15,114
(Sheldon on laptop screen:)The four of you are three of my closest
friends and one treasured acquaintance.

4
00:00:19,082 --> 00:00:22,502
(Sheldon on laptop screen:)Though I cannot state categorically
that my life will be diminished...

5
00:00:22,710 --> 00:00:27,920
(Sheldon on laptop screen:)...by not having you in it, I am
comfortable if you choose to believe that.

6
00:00:29,258 --> 00:00:33,098
(Sheldon on laptop screen:)Since you intend to remain
in this lawless metropolitan area...

7
00:00:33,262 --> 00:00:36,932
(Sheldon on laptop screen:)...statistics suggest that you will
succumb to tragic and gruesome ends...

8
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:40,640
(Sheldon on laptop screen:)...before we meet again.
Live long and prosper.

9
00:00:43,272 --> 00:00:45,482
(Penny:)Sheldon, that's so--

10
00:00:47,944 --> 00:00:56,024
You might wanna lock the door
behind me. This isn't Bozeman.

